.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p
    Review one billing invoice — current PEPM math, value delivered, amount due — and pay when payment is enabled.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p
    Invoices lock from OG Value Analysis on calculation day. Amounts round down to the nearest $0.50 and never exceed value delivered.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Open invoices can be paid from this page (payment checkout ships later; Pay is a stub for now).
    %li Use Print to paper or PDF for a browser print / save-as-PDF of this invoice (chrome, Pay, and OG Value Analysis are hidden; Value and PEPM explanations print as captions).
    %li Manual statuses while impersonating: Open or Waived (given away / free). Processor statuses (processing, paid, failed, refunded) are automation-only.
    %li Return to Billing for cadence, upcoming PEPM, and the full invoice lists.
